schema: https://powdrr.io/schemas/specification-v1
id: interactive-entity-exploration
title: Interactive Entity Exploration
requirements:
- id: req-1
  description: The workflow chat agent must support an interactive back-and-forth
    session when the user asks to see existing entities, allowing filtering, sorting,
    pagination, and selecting an entity to view details.
  state: added
- id: req-2
  description: The exploration session must end when the user says to end it, returning
    to the default prompt that asks what the user wants to do.
  state: added
- id: req-3
  description: On failure during the exploration session, the agent must handle the
    error gracefully and return to the default prompt.
  state: added
approach:
- id: appr-1
  description: Implement an interactive exploration loop that presents the list of
    existing entities with filtering, sorting, and pagination controls, and supports
    selecting an entity to view its details.
  state: added
- id: appr-2
  description: Detect the user's request to end the session and transition back to
    the default prompt asking what the user wants to do.
  state: added
- id: appr-3
  description: Wrap the exploration loop in error handling that gracefully returns
    to the default prompt on failure.
  state: added
